sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Grove / caller
  participant R as Rust front process
  participant W as Policy worker
  participant D as Record store
  participant H as Final harness
  G->>R: Authoritative request + inherited terminal/control env
  R->>W: Sanitized env, private cwd, bounded context, stdin closed
  W-->>R: Validated catalog, choice, evidence and reason
  R->>R: Reap worker, validate explicit choice and executable
  alt Inspect
    R-->>G: Proposal + limits + argv, no harness or run receipt
  else Run
    R->>D: Durable handoff-attempt record
    alt Write fails or cancellation observed
      R-->>G: Nonzero refusal, no harness
    else Admission succeeds
      R->>H: exec with original cwd, terminal and final env
      Note over R,H: Same PID and process group, Rust no longer exists
      H-->>G: Native exit / signal / completion channel
    end
  end
  Note over D: Handoff attempt is not confirmed execution or acceptance
